&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#quickstart&#34; &gt;Quickstart&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://coder.com/docs&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
